{"componentChunkName":"component---src-layouts-designer-layout-tsx","path":"/designers/dany-tabet/","result":{"data":{"strapiDesigner":{"id":"824ed67f-f152-5e34-9537-db23c337c102","strapi_id":36,"ShortDescription":"Dany Tabet is for the bride who loves a moment. Sculpted silhouettes, shimmering beadwork, and couture-level detail designed to turn heads. Glamorous, confident, and absolutely unforgettable. ","PriceRangeLow":"250000","PriceRangeHigh":"450000","Name":"DANY TABET","LongDescription":[{"children":[{"text":"Our favorite Beirut-based designer, Dany Tabet, launched his first atelier at just 23. Quickly becoming known for gowns that balance classic elegance with contemporary sensuality. His signature style blends intricate embroidery, the softest tulles, and luxurious lace and satins to create effortlessly feminine silhouettes. Each gown is thoughtfully crafted with sculptural detail and unexpected touches – perfect for the modern romantic bride who wants to feel both timeless and unforgettable. "}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]}],"ImageDesktop":[{"localFile":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#e8d8d8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/c784e82edb6337eb76e6294a450f9312/9d190/danytabet_desktop_7e617fed98.jpg","srcSet":"/static/c784e82edb6337eb76e6294a450f9312/fb016/danytabet_desktop_7e617fed98.jpg 360w,\n/static/c784e82edb6337eb76e6294a450f9312/cb3ef/danytabet_desktop_7e617fed98.jpg 720w,\n/static/c784e82edb6337eb76e6294a450f9312/9d190/danytabet_desktop_7e617fed98.jpg 1440w","sizes":"(min-width: 1440px) 1440px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/c784e82edb6337eb76e6294a450f9312/2d993/danytabet_desktop_7e617fed98.webp 360w,\n/static/c784e82edb6337eb76e6294a450f9312/fdc0a/danytabet_desktop_7e617fed98.webp 720w,\n/static/c784e82edb6337eb76e6294a450f9312/6e30a/danytabet_desktop_7e617fed98.webp 1440w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 1440px) 1440px, 100vw"}]}